# barista_config Feature Plan

**Last Updated:** 2026-01-01
**Project Stage:** Prototype
**Maintainer:** @scawful

## Overview

barista_config is a modern ImGui-based configuration tool for SketchyBar (Barista). It replaces the legacy Objective-C configuration menu with a cross-platform, visually rich interface built on the halext::gui framework.

**Vision:** Become the primary SketchyBar configuration tool, providing a live-editing experience with visual preview and instant feedback.

---

## Completed Features

### Foundation (Phase 1) ✅
- [x] Project structure created
- [x] ConfigManager implemented (JSON state management)
- [x] Basic window with GLFW + OpenGL
- [x] Sidebar navigation with Material Design icons
- [x] Integration with halext::gui framework
- [x] Theme system (Catppuccin, Nord, Dracula)

### Appearance View (Phase 2) ✅
**Status:** Complete (2026-01-01)

- [x] Bar color picker with hex code support
- [x] Height slider (0-60px)
- [x] Corner radius slider (0-30px)
- [x] Blur radius slider (0-100px)
- [x] Widget scale adjustment (0.5x-2.0x)
- [x] Color scheme presets (Catppuccin Mocha, Nord, Dracula)
- [x] Apply button with live reload
- [x] Read/write to `~/.config/sketchybar/state.json`

**Code Location:**
- `~/src/lab/barista_config/src/views/appearance.cc`
- `~/src/lab/barista_config/src/state/config_manager.cc`

---

## Pending Views

### Widgets View (Phase 3)
**Status:** Planned
**Priority:** P0
**Estimated Effort:** 3-4 days
**Timeline:** Week 1-2 (Jan 2026)

#### Features
1. **Widget Toggle Matrix**
   - Grid of checkboxes for each widget
   - Categories: System Info, Network, Audio, Battery, Custom
   - Enable/disable widgets individually
   - Reorder widgets via drag-and-drop

2. **Per-Widget Configuration**
   - Click widget to expand settings
   - Update interval (seconds)
   - Icon selection (from IconBrowser)
   - Color customization
   - Label format (printf-style templates)

3. **System Info Items**
   - CPU usage widget
   - Memory usage widget
   - Disk space widget
   - Network speed widget
   - Date/time widget
   - Active app widget

#### Implementation Plan
```cpp
// widgets.cc
struct WidgetConfig {
  std::string id;
  std::string label;
  std::string icon;
  bool enabled;
  int update_interval_ms;
  std::string color;
  std::string format;
};

void RenderWidgetsView(ConfigManager& config) {
  auto widgets = config.GetWidgets();

  for (auto& widget : widgets) {
    ImGui::PushID(widget.id.c_str());

    // Checkbox to enable/disable
    ImGui::Checkbox(widget.label.c_str(), &widget.enabled);

    // Expand settings
    if (ImGui::TreeNode("Settings")) {
      ImGui::InputInt("Update Interval (ms)", &widget.update_interval_ms);
      ImGui::InputText("Icon", &widget.icon);
      ImGui::ColorEdit3("Color", &widget.color);
      ImGui::InputText("Format", &widget.format);
      ImGui::TreePop();
    }

    ImGui::PopID();
  }

  if (ImGui::Button("Apply")) {
    config.SetWidgets(widgets);
    config.Save();
    ReloadSketchyBar();
  }
}
```

#### Files to Create
- `~/src/lab/barista_config/src/views/widgets.cc` (expand existing)
- `~/src/lab/barista_config/src/views/widgets.h` (expand existing)

#### Testing Checklist
- [ ] Toggle widget on/off
- [ ] Change widget color
- [ ] Change widget icon
- [ ] Reorder widgets
- [ ] Verify state persists to JSON
- [ ] Verify SketchyBar reloads correctly

---

### Icons View (Phase 4)
**Status:** Planned
**Priority:** P0
**Estimated Effort:** 2-3 days
**Timeline:** Week 2-3 (Jan 2026)

#### Features
1. **Icon Browser Integration**
   - Embed `halext::widgets::IconBrowser`
   - Search by name, category, tags
   - Grid view with adjustable size
   - Preview selected icon (large)

2. **Icon Assignment**
   - Select widget from dropdown
   - Choose icon from browser
   - One-click assignment
   - Visual confirmation

3. **Custom Icons**
   - Upload custom icon files (PNG, SVG)
   - Add to user library
   - Use in widgets

#### Implementation Plan
```cpp
// icons.cc
void RenderIconsView(ConfigManager& config) {
  static halext::widgets::IconBrowser browser;
  static std::string selected_widget;

  // Widget selector
  if (ImGui::BeginCombo("Assign to Widget", selected_widget.c_str())) {
    for (const auto& widget : config.GetWidgets()) {
      if (ImGui::Selectable(widget.label.c_str())) {
        selected_widget = widget.id;
      }
    }
    ImGui::EndCombo();
  }

  // Icon browser
  if (browser.Render()) {
    const auto* icon = browser.GetSelectedIcon();
    if (!selected_widget.empty()) {
      config.SetWidgetIcon(selected_widget, icon->code_point);
      config.Save();
    }
  }
}
```

