- `~/src/lab/barista_config/src/views/icons.cc` (expand existing)

#### Dependencies
- IconBrowser JSON loading (see halext TECHNICAL_DEBT.md)

#### Testing Checklist
- [ ] Search for icons
- [ ] Select icon from grid
- [ ] Assign icon to widget
- [ ] Verify icon appears in SketchyBar
- [ ] Upload custom icon

